{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05917","headline":"休假还旧业便使 · 王维","name":"休假还旧业便使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢病始告归，依依入桑梓。\n家人皆竚立，相候衡门里。\n时辈皆长年，成人旧童子。\n上堂嘉庆毕，顾与姻亲齿。\n论旧忽余悲，目存皆相喜。\n田园转芜没，但有寒泉水。\n衰柳日萧条，秋光清邑里。\n入门乍如客，休骑非便止。\n中饮顾王程，离忧从此始。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05917.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05917","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}